<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - March 21.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - March 21.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- Tunisia celebrates Independence Day.</p>
<p>- Consumer price index rises 0.2 percent in February.</p>
<p>ASSABAH</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali visits former president Bourguiba for Independence Day.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisian, Dutch officials discuss cooperation in tourism.</p>
</text>
